# Counting Number (/docs/primitives/animate-ui/counting-number)



## Installation [#installation]

```bash
npm install @animate-ui/react motion
```

## Usage [#usage]

```tsx
import { CountingNumber } from '@animate-ui/react/primitives/texts/counting-number';

export function Stat() {
  return <CountingNumber number={2025} inView />;
}
```

A new `number` springs on from where the count is instead of restarting it.

## Animation [#animation]

* Counts from `fromNumber` to `number` on a spring (`stiffness: 90, damping: 50`): most of the range goes by in the first second, then the last units tick in slowly (2025 lands after about 4.5s).
* The ticking value is written to the DOM directly, without a React render per frame.
* `transition` takes other spring options, or any Motion transition with a `type` or an `ease`.
* `<AnimateUIProvider tempo>` paces the default spring.
* Under reduced motion, the number shows its target right away.
* Screen readers read the target value once, never the ticking values.

## API Reference [#api-reference]

### CountingNumber [#countingnumber]

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `number` (required) | `number` |  | The number to count to. |
| `fromNumber` | `number` | `0` | The number to start counting from. |
| `padStart` | `boolean` | `false` | Pad the number with leading zeros to the length of `number`. |
| `decimalSeparator` | `string` | `'.'` | The separator of the decimal part. |
| `thousandSeparator` | `string` |  | The separator between groups of thousands, while counting too. |
| `decimalPlaces` | `number` | `0` | Decimal places to show. |
| `transition` | `SpringOptions \| Transition` | `{ stiffness: 90, damping: 50 }` | Transition of the count. Spring options animate as a spring; a transition with a `type` or an `ease` is used as is. |
| `delay` | `number` | `0` | Delay before counting, in milliseconds. |
| `initiallyStable` | `boolean` | `false` | Render `number` from the start, without counting. Useful with many counters on a page. |
| `inView` | `boolean` | `false` | Wait for the number to be in view before counting. |
| `inViewMargin` | `string` | `'0px'` | Margin of the in-view area. |
| `inViewOnce` | `boolean` | `true` | Only count the first time the number comes into view. |
| `...props` | `Omit<React.ComponentProps<'span'>, 'children'>` |  | Props of the root element. |

